    "body": "Can you please share your starship logs where you encounter the error:\r\n```sh\r\nSTARSHIP_LOG=trace starship prompt\r\n```\r\n\r\nMost of the heavy-lifting for the battery module is done by [svartalf/rust-battery](https://github.com/svartalf/rust-battery), so this may require an upstream issue to be created if we're receiving an unparsable output on M1 desktop machines.",
