    "updated_at": "2021-11-08T03:06:46Z",
    "body": "As mentioned by @matchai the heavy lifting is done by [the `battery` crate](https://github.com/svartalf/rust-battery), so it's best to open an issue there and ask for help.\r\n\r\nIf this warning does not appear on previous versions of macOS then it's Apple changing stuff. [The code for `darwin` platform in `battery` crate](https://github.com/svartalf/rust-battery/tree/master/battery/src/platform/darwin) hasn't been updated for over a year, probably that's the issue.\r\n\r\nFor now the best thing you can do is to disable the `battery` module on machines without a battery, as commented in https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/2800#issuecomment-951956393.",
